  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All weapons capable of firing Slugs and/or Shells</p>\n<p><em>You don't need special sights, rifling, or smartlinks to ensure a target drops — you need a bigger tube to fire your slugs and buckshot out of.</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV17 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Shotgun Rechamber may be installed. Once installed, this attachment can not be uninstalled. When installed, the weapon's Single Shot and Shotgun Shell damage is increased by 1d6, to a maximum of 5d6 in either mode (Unless its base damage is higher, in which case that takes over and is not increased). Unless installed in cyberware, the weapon must now be wielded in two hands to fire, even if it was previously a one-handed weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
